  npcName: 
  _lines:
  - Birds? How DARE you, those are my beautiful well behaved babies... My bundles
    of absolute JOY, I am a proud parent of those threee ANGELS.
  - Anything else I can help you with?
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - My sister wants some water and I can't find any.
  - I dunno.
